    {
      "name": "6 — O laboratorio sozinho, sem EMR",
      "description": "Nenhum controlador da API verifica o tipo do cliente: o que decide e o ambito da chave e a unidade/laboratorio a que ela esta presa. Um cliente `sislab` com `orders:write` cria pedidos como qualquer EMR — e o caso do doente que chega ao balcao do laboratorio sem guia.\n\nA diferenca fica gravada: o `source_system` do pedido passa a `sislab` em vez de `emr`, por isso o no nacional distingue quem o criou.\n\nPara correr esta pasta com uma chave propria, crie um segundo cliente do tipo `sislab`, unidade `HCM`, laboratorio `HCM-LAB`, com os ambitos `orders:write`, `orders:read`, `results:write`, `referrals:write`, `dictionary:read`, e ponha a chave em `lab_api_key`. Com a chave unica da coleccao tambem funciona.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Pedido criado pelo balcao do laboratorio",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Idempotency-Key",
                "value": "{{$guid}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v3/order-requests",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v3",
                "order-requests"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Repare que nao leva `sending_facility_code`. Quando falta, o pedido usa a unidade da propria chave (app/models/order_request.rb:19) — o laboratorio nao tem de repetir aquilo que a chave ja diz.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"patient\": {\n    \"national_id\": \"120000000999X\",\n    \"name\": \"Nelia Zandamela\",\n    \"sex\": \"F\",\n    \"birthdate\": \"1993-09-27\",\n    \"phone\": \"840000999\"\n  },\n  \"order\": {\n    \"receiving_lab_code\": \"{{lab_code}}\",\n    \"priority\": \"routine\",\n    \"requested_by\": \"Balcao do laboratorio\",\n    \"order_location\": \"Laboratorio\",\n    \"clinical_history\": \"Doente sem guia, pedido levantado no proprio laboratorio.\",\n    \"collected_at\": \"2026-08-18T09:30:00+02:00\",\n    \"specimen_type\": {\n      \"national_code\": \"MOZ-SP-0001\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"tests\": [\n    {\n      \"test_type\": {\n        \"national_code\": \"MOZ-TT-0001\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const b = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (b.data && b.data.tracking_number) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('tracking_number', b.data.tracking_number);",
                  "  console.log('tracking_number =', b.data.tracking_number);",
                  "}",
                  "pm.test('201 criado', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Pedido por um painel inteiro",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Idempotency-Key",
                "value": "{{$guid}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v3/order-requests",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v3",
                "order-requests"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Um painel em vez de testes soltos. Use `test_panel` no lugar de `test_type`.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"patient\": {\n    \"national_id\": \"120000000888W\",\n    \"name\": \"Hercilio Banze\",\n    \"sex\": \"M\",\n    \"birthdate\": \"1971-01-15\",\n    \"phone\": \"840000888\"\n  },\n  \"order\": {\n    \"receiving_lab_code\": \"{{lab_code}}\",\n    \"priority\": \"routine\",\n    \"requested_by\": \"Balcao do laboratorio\",\n    \"collected_at\": \"2026-08-18T09:30:00+02:00\",\n    \"specimen_type\": {\n      \"national_code\": \"MOZ-SP-0001\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"tests\": [\n    {\n      \"test_panel\": {\n        \"national_code\": \"MOZ-TP-0001\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const b = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (b.data && b.data.tracking_number) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('tracking_number', b.data.tracking_number);",
                  "  console.log('tracking_number =', b.data.tracking_number);",
                  "}",
                  "pm.test('201 criado', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Referir a amostra para outro laboratorio",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
